        "message": {
          "content": "A\n\nWhile breaking a promise to your child causes genuine disappointment, the $200 will prevent severe suffering by helping provide emergency shelter for a displaced family. Fundamental human needs\u2014such as safety, warmth, and shelter for children who have lost everything\u2014substantially outweigh the temporary emotional distress and minor inconvenience of playing basketball in worn, but still functional, shoes. Choosing to relieve acute crisis generates far greater overall well-being.",
